  "rawText": "|\n\nee\n\non oo\n\nNAME:\n\nDATE OF BIRTH:\nPLACE OF BIRTH:\nMOTHER’S NAME:\nFATHER’S NAME:\nBIRTH ORDER:\nOCCUPATION:\nRELATIONSHIP:\nTALENTS:\nSKILLS:\n\nGOALS:\n\nDISLIKES:\n\nOFFSPRING:\nMOTTO:\n\nNAME:\n\nDATE OF BIRTH:\nPLACE OF BIRTH:\nWIFE’S NAME:\nMOTHER’S NAME:\nFATHER’S NAME:\nBIRTH GRDER:\nOCCUPATION:\nRELATIONSHIP:\nINTERESTS:\nABILITIES:\nDISLIKES:\n\nGOALS:\n\nOFFSPRING:\n\nErdine Francis Eatmon\n\nSeptember 28, 1942\nEnfield, North Carolina\nEulilla Goins Francis\nEddie Rufus Francis, Sr.\n\nSeventh child of eleven children\nSecretary at BCBSNCA, and a student at Prince George's Community College.\n\nGranddaughter\nHave not discovered one at the present time.\n\nPC Computer\nMy goals are to help my children to escape the violence and drugs that are so\n\nprevalent in our society today.\n\n| dislike the young people of today’s society who\n\ndo not have respect for themselves or for others.\n\nCamilla Regina and George, Jr.\n\nEducation is our passport to the future, for tomorrow belongs to the people who\n\nprepare for it today.\n\nGeorge Glenn Eatmon, Sr.\n\nJanuary 6, 1937\n\nMacro, N.C.\n\nErdine Francis Eatmon\n\nBobree Mozell Eatmon\n\nGlenn Herbert Eatmon\n\nSecond child of four children\n\nRetired from Sears Roebuck & Company\nGrandson-in-law\n\nDeep Sea Fishing\n\nWorking with the young boys in my community\n\nYoung people who think the world owes them something,\n\nbut they don’t have anything to give in return.\n\nMy goals are to see my son and daughter reach their goals in life, and to be\n\nsuccessful.\nCamilla Regina and George, Jr.\n\nSAAS\n\n-\n\nSRS\n\nRe Saves Do ee ee fe Oe\n\nte <2\", ih.\n\nSO te We a A Sey te Oh\n\nER ae",
  "cleanedText": "I\n\nee\n\non oo\n\nNAME:\n\nDATE OF BIRTH:\nPLACE OF BIRTH:\nMOTHER’S NAME:\nFATHER’S NAME:\nBIRTH ORDER:\nOCCUPATION:\nRELATIONSHIP:\nTALENTS:\nSKILLS:\n\nGOALS:\n\nDISLIKES:\n\nOFFSPRING:\nMOTTO:\n\nNAME:\n\nDATE OF BIRTH:\nPLACE OF BIRTH:\nWIFE’S NAME:\nMOTHER’S NAME:\nFATHER’S NAME:\nBIRTH GRDER:\nOCCUPATION:\nRELATIONSHIP:\nINTERESTS:\nABILITIES:\nDISLIKES:\n\nGOALS:\n\nOFFSPRING:\n\nErdine Francis Eatmon\n\nSeptember 28, 1942\nEnfield, North Carolina\nEulilla Goins Francis\nEddie Rufus Francis, Sr.\n\nSeventh child of eleven children\nSecretary at BCBSNCA, and a student at Prince George's Community College.\n\nGranddaughter\nHave not discovered one at the present time.\n\nPC Computer\nMy goals are to help my children to escape the violence and drugs that are so\n\nprevalent in our society today.\n\nI dislike the young people of today’s society who\n\ndo not have respect for themselves or for others.\n\nCamilla Regina and George, Jr.\n\nEducation is our passport to the future, for tomorrow belongs to the people who\n\nprepare for it today.\n\nGeorge Glenn Eatmon, Sr.\n\nJanuary 6, 1937\n\nMacro, N.C.\n\nErdine Francis Eatmon\n\nBobree Mozell Eatmon\n\nGlenn Herbert Eatmon\n\nSecond child of four children\n\nRetired from Sears Roebuck & Company\nGrandson-in-law\n\nDeep Sea Fishing\n\nWorking with the young boys in my community\n\nYoung people who think the world owes them something,\n\nbut they don’t have anything to give in return.\n\nMy goals are to see my son and daughter reach their goals in life, and to be\n\nsuccessful.\nCamilla Regina and George, Jr.\n\nSAAS\n\n-\n\nSRS\n\nRe Saves Do ee ee fe Oe\n\nte <2\", ih.\n\nSO te We a A Sey te Oh\n\nER ae",
